# Copy to .dev.vars for `pnpm dev` / `pnpm preview` (never committed).
# OPTIONAL. Without it POST /api/resources and POST /api/refresh answer 401,
# as upstream ships; with it, a request carrying
# `Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>` may add or replace a page and clear
# the enriched cache. On a deployed environment it is the Orun secret of the
# same name, pushed to the Worker as a Worker secret on deploy.
ADMIN_TOKEN=
